  <jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row13Member">東洋観光㈱</jpcrp_cor:ConsolidatedSubsidiariesMetricsOfConsolidatedSubsidiaries>
