&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;（注）乗車効率の算出方法&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:50pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:136.2pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
